    what: "M3.3 (#305): a Pattern Chest holding a blank pattern and a pickaxe-head pattern stack (two different items, so SimpleContainer#addItem's reload can't merge them into one slot and mask a real regression), saved before its self-expanding capacity landed. SimpleContainer's list is positionless (same note as m2_tool_station_inventory.snbt) -- decoding this still refills starting at slot 0 and computes capacity 54 from that, exactly what a pre-#305 54-slot chest would already have produced, so this pins that the capacity change is additive rather than a save break."
